; the passing train — a horn going by, insects over the water, a cathedral that climbs
; fader1 how far away the track is; fader2 how fast it passes; fader3 how much the cathedral climbs

2026-11-24
----------
the horn is chord 2 samplerate=half
the track is doppler distance=0.3 speed=0.4 samplerate=half
the rain is rain 2
the insects are swarm density=0.6 chaos=0.8 pitch=1 samplerate=half
the nave is shimmer size=0.7 shimmer=0.4 interval=12 samplerate=quarter

horn -> track
fader1 -> track.distance
fader2 -> track.speed
track.left -> left
track.right -> right
rain -> insects
insects.left -40> left
insects.right -40> right
track.left -> nave
fader3 -> nave.shimmer
nave.left -50> left
nave.right -50> right
